#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:5
#: 8499e19f8f4c47678154460dfac71fb3
msgid "Motor and Servo Connections"
msgstr "电机与舵机连接"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:7
#: c98295802032410aa1fc59b4e5511b4d
msgid ""
"Two steering/throttle methods are supported and each requires slightly "
"different wiring and configuration as described below."
msgstr "支持两种转向/油门控制方式，每种方式所需的接线和配置略有不同，详见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:10
#: cea9cdc0b33d49e2b2e123a8527db2cb
msgid "Separate Steering and Throttle"
msgstr "独立转向与油门"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:12
#: a71f1e36eefe4df6b0b111039a178e38
msgid ""
"Most RC cars are like full sized cars in that they have separate steering "
"and throttle controls. For these rovers, the steering servo (which normally "
"turns the front wheels) should be connected to the autopilot's RC Output 1."
"  The motor's ESC (which normally controls the speed of the back wheels) "
"should be connected to RC Output 3."
msgstr ""
"大多数遥控车与全尺寸汽车一样，具有独立的转向和油门控制。对于此类 Rover，转向舵机（通常控制前轮转向）应连接到飞控的 RC 输出 1，电机 "
"ESC（通常控制后轮速度）应连接到 RC 输出 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:18
#: 24a5d1b70c1f4e45a4327ff8c94add37
msgid ""
"For this setup these parameters values should be set (they should actually "
"be set by default).  More details can be found on the :ref:`Motor and Servo "
"Configuration <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>` page."
msgstr ""
"对于此配置，应设置以下参数值（默认情况下应已正确设置）。更多详情请参见 :ref:`电机与舵机配置 <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"configuration>` 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:20
#: 00e60f280b15442e8917368cf92662b7
msgid ":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION <SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 26 (Ground Steering)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION <SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 26（地面转向）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:21
#: b81be683a1814ae3bcbbc5529ac0dd14
msgid ":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION <SERVO3_FUNCTION>` = 70 (Throttle)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION <SERVO3_FUNCTION>` = 70（油门）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:26
#: 6dbfd6230b6a484e9afab6da0b6ec1c1
msgid "Skid Steering"
msgstr "差速转向"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:28
#: 5bab6ee6eb324a8db4523297c407a082
msgid ""
"\"Skid steering\" vehicles (like R2D2) control their direction and "
"forward/reverse motions by varying the speed of two (or more) independent "
"wheels.  For these style rovers the left wheel should be connected to RC "
"Output 1 and the right wheel should be connected to RC Output 3."
msgstr ""
"「差速转向」车辆（如 R2D2）通过改变两个（或多个）独立车轮的速度来控制方向和前进/后退。对于此类 Rover，左轮应连接到 RC 输出 "
"1，右轮应连接到 RC 输出 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:33
#: 3bd1d27330c1414fbcfb121a7e77e85a
msgid ""
"For this setup these parameters values will need to be set.  More details "
"can be found on the :ref:`Motor and Servo Configuration <rover-motor-and-"
"servo-configuration>` page."
msgstr ""
"对于此配置，需要设置以下参数值。更多详情请参见 :ref:`电机与舵机配置 <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>`"
" 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:35
#: dd3efc65d1b64f1abed8ebd5cea511dc
msgid ":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION <SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 73 (Throttle Left)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION <SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 73（左侧油门）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:36
#: 40e91f66928745aeb3ddb6c32da6547a
msgid ":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION <SERVO3_FUNCTION>` = 74 (Throttle Right)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION <SERVO3_FUNCTION>` = 74（右侧油门）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:39
#: 651fe9eb682f43ba8ded634af83b1a25
msgid "Omni Vehicles"
msgstr "全向车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:41
#: 92bc62e7245340cc95bb1ef198b5d17a
msgid ""
"Omni vehicles can move laterally (i.e. left and right) without changing "
"their heading with the help of omni wheels (`like these from RobotShop "
"<https://www.robotshop.com/en/6-duraomni-wheel.html>`__) or thrusters.  "
"ArduPilot supports three configurations X, Plus and \"3\".  The autopilot "
"motor outputs that should be connected to each motor are shown below."
msgstr ""
"全向车辆借助全向轮（`如 RobotShop 的此类产品 <https://www.robotshop.com/en/6-duraomni-"
"wheel.html>`__）或推进器，无需改变航向即可横向（即左右）移动。ArduPilot 支持 X 型、Plus 型和「3 "
"轮」三种配置，各电机对应的飞控输出端口如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:46
#: 410047b1116d4b2b84000fea5e760f2a
msgid ""
"Another style of wheel is Mecanum (`like these from RobotShop "
"<https://www.robotshop.com/products/80mm-right-mecanum-wheel>`__). For these"
" wheels, the autopilot motor outputs that should be connected to each motor "
"are shown below."
msgstr ""
"另一种车轮类型是麦克纳姆轮（`如 RobotShop 的此类产品 <https://www.robotshop.com/products/80mm-"
"right-mecanum-wheel>`__）。对于此类车轮，各电机对应的飞控输出端口如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:52
#: 945bd0ab614448ae8a6aa5fed63ccafd
msgid "For this setup these parameters values will need to be set"
msgstr "对于此配置，需要设置以下参数值"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:54
#: a33fb3cf5db042f08ed9c895757616c2
msgid ""
":ref:`FRAME_TYPE <FRAME_TYPE>` = 1 (Omni3), 2 (OmniX), 3 (OmniPlus) or 4 "
"(Omni3Mecanum)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FRAME_TYPE <FRAME_TYPE>` = 1（Omni3）、2（OmniX）、3（OmniPlus）或 "
"4（Omni3Mecanum）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:55
#: 008a3c327c124b8e9a2fc35b3661c96e
msgid ":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION <SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 33 (motor1)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION <SERVO1_FUNCTION>` = 33（电机1）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:56
#: c9224e1c9b7b4ccbadbb20f8f26aff31
msgid ":ref:`SERVO2_FUNCTION <SERVO2_FUNCTION>` = 34 (motor2)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERVO2_FUNCTION <SERVO2_FUNCTION>` = 34（电机2）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-motor-and-servo-connections.rst:57
#: c821b390f5874f5abd6ff90c40430a7e
msgid ":ref:`SERVO3_FUNCTION <SERVO3_FUNCTION>` = 35 (motor3)"
